  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 17272073cbcc03d4b82d101449fb470b, type: 3}
  m_Name: OldTriangle_Repeat1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ProjectCircle.Systems.Dialogue
  speaker: Old Triangle
  lines:
  - Still here? Good. Listen, then.
  - 'Every village keeps a Mould: the secret of its shape. With one, even a circle
    could become something else.'
  - But wear another shape too long and the whispers will find their way in. Mind
    yourself.
